# Terraform
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example
# Keep the lock file - ensures consistent provider versions across machines
# **/.terraform.lock.hcl

# Kubeconfig / credentials
*.kubeconfig
kubeconfig

# direnv - .envrc files contain secrets and are gitignored
# Copy .envrc.example to .envrc and fill in your values
**/.envrc
!**/.envrc.example

# Terraform temporary files written during apply
**/*.tmp

# Generated local env overrides (written by scripts/update-env.sh)
**/.env.local

# macOS
.DS_Store
argocd-octopus-demo.code-workspace
**/next-wave.md
